---
description: Guidelines for development
alwaysApply: true
---

- **Iterative Development**: Prefer committing small, iterative changes
- **Git Commits**: Do not commit code changes to git unless given permission to do so. Ask when you are ready to do this. LucaVRE-api is the top level directory for this and has git initialized
- **Idempotency**: Code changes must not break existing functionality. Run `bundle exec rspec` according to instructions in your .cursorrules before declaring a task complete.
